§ `s 13 the waiting period (src:398)`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 13 the claimant has served a waiting period of one week of unemployment` 0)
#ASSERT `s 13 the claimant has served a waiting period of one week of unemployment` 1
#ASSERT `s 13 the claimant has served a waiting period of one week of unemployment` 2
#ASSERT `s 13 the claimant is entitled to be paid benefits in the benefit period` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 13 the claimant is entitled to be paid benefits in the benefit period` FALSE)

§ `s 13.1 a week deemed to be a week for which benefits would otherwise be payable (src:400-406)`
-- args: the rate of weekly benefits, the week's earnings (as for s 19(2))
-- Rate under $200: only earnings above $50 reduce the benefit; the week counts if something is left.
#ASSERT `s 13.1(1) the week of unemployment is deemed to be a week of unemployment for which benefits would otherwise be payable` 150 0
#ASSERT `s 13.1(1) the week of unemployment is deemed to be a week of unemployment for which benefits would otherwise be payable` 150 50
#ASSERT `s 13.1(1) the week of unemployment is deemed to be a week of unemployment for which benefits would otherwise be payable` 150 199.99
#ASSERT NOT (`s 13.1(1) the week of unemployment is deemed to be a week of unemployment for which benefits would otherwise be payable` 150 200)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 13.1(1) the week of unemployment is deemed to be a week of unemployment for which benefits would otherwise be payable` 150 800)
#ASSERT `s 13.1(1) the week of unemployment is deemed to be a week of unemployment for which benefits would otherwise be payable` 199 248.99
#ASSERT NOT (`s 13.1(1) the week of unemployment is deemed to be a week of unemployment for which benefits would otherwise be payable` 199 249)
-- Rate of $200 or more: earnings above 25% of the rate reduce it.
#ASSERT `s 13.1(1) the week of unemployment is deemed to be a week of unemployment for which benefits would otherwise be payable` 200 249.99
#ASSERT NOT (`s 13.1(1) the week of unemployment is deemed to be a week of unemployment for which benefits would otherwise be payable` 200 250)
#ASSERT `s 13.1(1) the week of unemployment is deemed to be a week of unemployment for which benefits would otherwise be payable` 400 499
#ASSERT NOT (`s 13.1(1) the week of unemployment is deemed to be a week of unemployment for which benefits would otherwise be payable` 400 500)
-- 25% of 203 is 50.75, rounded under s 6(2) to 51: earnings of 253.90 leave 0.10 of the benefit; 254 leaves nothing.
#ASSERT `s 13.1(1) the week of unemployment is deemed to be a week of unemployment for which benefits would otherwise be payable` 203 253.9
#ASSERT NOT (`s 13.1(1) the week of unemployment is deemed to be a week of unemployment for which benefits would otherwise be payable` 203 254)
